  itemId: block_road_bridge
  displayName: Bridge Deck
  description: 'A deck cell for crossing water. Laid by the road paver where the
    line reaches a stream or a river, held up on piers rather than draped over the
    ground, so the road runs straight over instead of diving in. Built from iron
    and stone: it has to hold itself up over nothing, and that is why it costs what
    it costs.'
